sequenceDiagram
    participant SpringBoot as Spring Boot
    participant CommandLineRunner
    participant Instantiation
    participant userRepository
    participant postRepository
    participant SimpleDateFormat
    participant Author
    participant Post
    participant Database

    SpringBoot->>CommandLineRunner: invoke run method
    Note right of CommandLineRunner: Executes after application startup

    CommandLineRunner->>Instantiation: create SimpleDateFormat -GMT timezone
    Instantiation-->>CommandLineRunner: SimpleDateFormat -(Date formatter with GMT timezone)

    CommandLineRunner->>userRepository: deleteAll
    Note right of userRepository: Clear existing authors
    userRepository->>Database: DELETE FROM authors
    Database-->>userRepository: deletion complete

    CommandLineRunner->>postRepository: deleteAll
    Note right of postRepository: Clear existing posts
    postRepository->>Database: DELETE FROM posts
    Database-->>postRepository: deletion complete

    CommandLineRunner->>Instantiation: create Author objects
    Instantiation-->>CommandLineRunner: List[Author] -(List of Author entities)

    CommandLineRunner->>userRepository: saveAll(authors)
    userRepository->>Database: INSERT INTO authors
    Database-->>userRepository: authors persisted -(Persisted authors with IDs)

    CommandLineRunner->>Instantiation: create Post objects -with parsed dates
    Instantiation-->>CommandLineRunner: List[Post] -(List of Post entities)

    CommandLineRunner->>postRepository: saveAll(posts)
    postRepository->>Database: INSERT INTO posts
    Database-->>postRepository: posts persisted -(Persisted posts with IDs)

    CommandLineRunner->>Author: getPosts.addAll(posts)
    Note right of CommandLineRunner: Associate posts with author

    CommandLineRunner->>userRepository: save(author with posts)
    Note right of userRepository: Persist author with post associations
    userRepository->>Database: UPDATE authors with post associations
    Database-->>userRepository: update complete